 "title": "Auditors &amp; Welfare Office - Fall River County, South Dakota",
 "text": "Auditors & Welfare Office - Fall River County, South Dakota\nSkip to content\nOctober 18, 2026\nFall River County, South Dakota\n906 N. River Street, Hot Springs, SD 57747\nHome\nOnline Map\nDirectory »\nAuditors & Welfare Office\nPublic Health Nurse\nDirector of Equalization\nEmergency Management\n4-H/Extension Service\nGIS Maps\nHighway Department\nPlanning & Zoning\nRegister of Deeds\nTreasurer\nVeteran’s Services\nWeed & Pest\nCommission »\nMeeting\nCounty Commissioners\nCounty Ordinances\n2026 Minute Archive\n2025 Minute Archive\n2024 Minute Archive\nOlder Minute Archives\nLaw & Court »\nClerk of Court\nSheriff\nState’s Attorney\nPress Release Archive\nEmployment (2)\nContact\nOglala Lakota Co.\nAuditors & Welfare Office\nService:\nLast Tax Deed Sale was held Thursday, June 18th 2026\nElection Information\nMill Levy information by Tax Entity (Last four years)\nMill Levy Sheet 2025 (taxes payable 2026)\nMill Levy Sheet 2024 (taxes payable 2025)\nMill Levy Sheet 2023 (taxes payable 2024)\nMill Levy Sheet 2022 (taxes payable 2023)\nMill Levy Sheet Archive\nAudit Reports\nCounty Poor Relief Guidelines 2017\n2026 Report – Taxes, Taxable Value, Mill Levies\n2025 Report – Taxes, Taxable Value , Tax Distribution\n2024 Report – Tax Distribution\n2023 Report – Taxes, Taxable Value, Mill Levies\n2022 Report – Taxes, Taxable Value, Mill Levies\n2021 Report – Taxes, Taxable Value, Mill Levies\nNew Housing Report\nPress Release Archive\nMission:\nThe Auditor’s Office is responsible for auditing all accounts and maintaining all financial records in and for Fall River County. This includes processing payroll, preparing the annual budget, establishing levies and apportioning of all tax collections. Monthly audits of all cash and cash items in the hands of the County Treasurer and a verification of bank account balances are performed. Annual Financial Reports are prepared indicating the receipts and expenditures, liabilities and equity, and assets of the County.\nThe Auditor is the clerk for the Board of County Commissioners and keeps an accurate record of their official proceedings including the Board of Equalization hearings. The Auditor preserves all documents, books, and records as required by law.\nThe Auditor performs all the duties required by law relative to all County, State and Federal elections held in the County. The Auditor also maintains all records of voter registration and election history.\nAuditor’s Office:\n906 N. River St.\nHot Springs, SD 57747\nPhone: (605) 745-5130\nauditor@fallrivercountysd.gov\nsue.ganje@state.sd.us\nFax: (605) 745-6835\nCounty Auditor: Sue Ganje Email: sue.ganje@state.sd.us\nDeputy Auditor: Stacy Schmidt Email: bookkeeping@fallrivercountysd.gov\nAdministrative Assistant : Teri Seamark Email: agenda@fallrivercountysd.gov\nPayroll & Payable: Bobbie Janis Email: billing@fallrivercountysd.gov/payroll@fallrivercountysd.gov\nElections Administrative Assistant: Arrow Bettelyoun Email: election@fallrivercountysd.gov\nTreasurer\nReal Estate Tax Payment Information\nMill Levy Sheet 2024 pay 2025\nMilly Levy by Entity\nProperty Tax Lookup\nSouth Dakota Grassland Fire Danger Index\nNational Grassland Fire Ban\nNational Forest Fire Ban\nNational Active Fires Map\nSouth Annex Building Schedule\nFall River County Contact List\nContact List\nNational Association of Counties\nhttp://www.naco.org/\nWebsite Survey\nWe would love to hear from you! Please fill out this form and we will get in touch with you shortly.\nEmail\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nWhere did you hear about our website? *\nSearch Engine\nNewspaper\nFriend\nOther\nWhat information were you looking for on this website? *\nGeneral Information\nSpecific Information\nJust Curious\nOther\nDid you find the information you were looking for? *\nYes\nNo\nMaybe\nWhat information were you looking for? (Please be specific so that we can improve our website.)\nPlease include your email below if you wish to be contacted regarding your question or request for information. Only those who provided a request for information above will will receive a response.\nSubmit\nEmployee Portal\nReturn to top of page\nCopyright © 2026 on Genesis Framework · WordPress · Log in\nNotifications",
